l"}, {"title": "www.biospectrumasia.com", "url": "https://www.biospectrumasia.com/article/pdf/4585"}, {"title": "padmaawards.gov.in", "url": "https://padmaawards.gov.in/Document/pdf/notifications/PadmaAwards/1982.pdf"}, {"title": "Kader Khan, Mohanlal, Manoj Bajpayee, Prabhudeva", "url": "https://www.ibtimes.co.in/kader-khan-mohanlal-manoj-bajpayee-prabhudheva-named-padma-honours-790759"}, {"title": "Open Access", "url": "https://www.i-scholar.in/index.php/CURS/article/view/194688/0"}, {"title": "prez gives away padma awards", "url": "https://www.deccanherald.com/content/327429/prez-gives-away-padma-awards.html"}]}, "Search results confirm that Dr. M. K. Bhan received the Padma Bhushan in the 2013 awards.\n\n- **Award announcement:** The 2013 list was published on January 25, 2013, on the eve of Republic Day. BioSpectrum reported that Bhan, the former Secretary of the Department of Biotechnology, would receive the Padma Bhushan, while his successor, K. VijayRaghavan, would get the Padma Shri. Dr Bhan will get the Padma Bhushan award while Prof VijayRaghavan will be conferred the Padma Shri awards.\n- **Context:** Dr Bhan, a pediatric surgeon and researcher, had relinquished office as Secretary, DBT, on November 30,2012 after an 8-year stint, a tenure in which he oversaw work on national biotech policy and regulation.\n- **Recognition:** A BioSpectrum article from January 28, 2013 described the Padma Bhushan as the third highest civilian award in the Republic of India after the Bharat Ratna and the Padma Vibhushan, for his contributions to Indian science.\n- **Ceremony:** A Deccan Herald report on the investiture ceremony at Rashtrapati Bhavan lists Dr. Maharaj Kishan Bhan among the Padma Bhushan awardees. That article is undated in the results, but it mentions London Olympics medallists, which suggests it covers the 2013 ceremony. I haven't confirmed that date."], "durationSeconds": 5.619842833000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01T3NiSgPjBebLVoowZoWPgx", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
